                <item>
                <title><![CDATA[【General Music Discussion】Don't you also hate it when they add rap verses to beautiful pop or R&amp;B songs?]]></title>
                <link><![CDATA[https://sharemania.us/threads/dont-you-also-hate-it-when-they-add-rap-verses-to-beautiful-pop-or-r-b-songs.299822/]]></link>
                <description><![CDATA[<article>
				<blockquote class="messageText SelectQuoteContainer ugc baseHtml">
					
					Idk why record companies ruin beautiful songs with mediocre rap verses. I have been on this site for a while, and many of the stuff I post are "no rap versions" and I make my own custom no rap edits and share them here. Many of the no rap versions are either not available or found in promo CDs which we can't even find on discogs. Just needed to vent about it.
					<div class="messageTextEndMarker">&nbsp;</div>
				</blockquote>
			</article>]]></description>
